        given-names: Timothy P.
      - family-names: Mann
        given-names: Robert W.
    title: >-
      Characterization of microstructural anisotropy in orthotropic materials
      using a second rank tensor
    journal: Journal of Materials Science
    year: 1984
    volume: 19
    notes: >-
      Tensor MIL del que sale el grado de anisotropia.
  - type: article
    authors:
      - family-names: Pistoia
        given-names: W.
    title: >-
      Estimation of distal radius failure load with micro-finite element
      analysis models based on three-dimensional peripheral quantitative
      computed tomography images
    journal: Bone
    year: 2002
    volume: 30
    notes: >-
      Criterio de fallo implementado en spinpy.resistencia. Sus dos parametros
